Text:
Mediterranean Fabliaux
Translated by Leni Aria

We see through the same Eye,

The twenty-two stars nearest to her shine with identical light.

In the age of plague, a woman wreathed in flame points to the night,

Her will opens the door to the mysterious Outland;

Her bloodline intertwines with our destiny;

Her Eye gazes there eternally;

Those beheld shall all receive her guidance.
